; Spec section 6.12: an access that would end past its region is a runtime
; error, before anything is read: the last 4 bytes of the PL011's 4096 are
; at 4092, so a 4-byte read at 4093 is out of range, not misaligned, since
; range is checked first.

(def main () int
  (let u (region_open 150994944 4096)
    (let a (region_read32 u 4092)
      (region_read32 u 4093))))
